clawd-moji — fan-made sticker collection

The Clawd character is the property of Anthropic, PBC (https://www.anthropic.com).
This repository is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Anthropic.

The pixel artwork is fan-created, based on the Clawd pixel art shared by the
clawd-on-desk project (https://github.com/rullerzhou-afk/clawd-on-desk).
All artwork in this repository may be used for personal, non-commercial
purposes only. No commercial use is permitted.

中文说明：本仓库为粉丝创作，与 Anthropic 无任何关联；Clawd 角色版权归
Anthropic 所有；像素素材为粉丝复刻，出处为 clawd-on-desk 项目；仓库内
全部内容仅供个人非商业使用，禁止商用。
